%% Main loop (layer 2): one Codex dispatch from submission through push to review.
%% Index and code mapping: docs/dev/arch-assets.md
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Control source
  participant F as Front door
  participant C as Core
  participant X as Codex (Desktop or App Server)
  participant N as Native session store
  S->>F: act codex_create {prompt, pack, notify}
  F->>C: private IPC with authenticated source
  C->>C: reserve receipt (requestId)
  C->>C: resolve dispatch policy and pack
  C->>X: start thread and first turn
  C->>C: bind notification to thread, turn and target
  C-->>S: receipt: submitted, threadId, turnId
  Note over S: ends its turn and waits
  X->>N: writes rollout while working
  C->>N: observes the turn
  C->>C: turn lifecycle reaches terminal
  C->>C: schedule delivery (batch window, token bucket)
  C-->>S: L1 push via claude CLI: done
  S->>F: query codex_read view:review
  F->>C: forward
  C-->>S: outcome, marks inbox events read
  S->>F: act codex_review {verdict}
